{"out": "/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-batuhancakir-Documents-Dev-learning-local-turbopuffer/5c9dc602-fa08-4ce7-9873-9159ae34289b/scratchpad/demo-docs/out/Home/apartment-lease.pdf", "kind": "pdf", "body": "# Residential Lease Agreement\nLease reference LR-3B-2025\n\n## Parties\nLandlord: Linden Row Properties Ltd., 2 Market Lane, Harborview.\nProperty manager and contact: Maria Okafor, phone +00 555 0142, lettings@lindenrow.example.\nTenant: Alex Morgan.\n\n## Property\n14 Linden Row, Apartment 3B, Harborview. Two rooms, kitchen, bathroom, balcony, cellar compartment no. 7.\n\n## Term\nThe lease starts on 1 May 2025 and runs for an indefinite period.\n\n## Rent and service charges\nMonthly rent: 1,180.00 EUR. Service charges paid in advance: 210.00 EUR per month (heating, water, building cleaning, waste). The total of 1,390.00 EUR is due by the third working day of each month.\nThe landlord settles the service charges once a year and sends the statement by 31 December.\n\n## Security deposit\nThe security deposit is 3,540.00 EUR, three months' rent. The tenant paid it on 15 April 2025 (reference DEP-2025-0388). The landlord keeps it in a separate deposit account and returns it with interest within six months after the tenant moves out, less any proven claims.\n\n## Notice period\nThe tenant may end the lease with three months' notice to the end of a calendar month, in writing.\nThe landlord's notice period follows the statutory rules.\n\n## Pets and subletting\nSmall pets are allowed. Dogs and cats need the landlord's written consent. Subletting needs written consent.\n\n## Repairs\nReport defects to the property manager without delay. Small repairs up to 100.00 EUR per case are paid by the tenant, at most 400.00 EUR per year.\n\nSigned in Harborview on 10 April 2025.\n", "title": "Residential Lease Agreement, 14 Linden Row, Apartment 3B", "author": "Linden Row Properties Ltd.", "subject": "Lease for Apartment 3B from 1 May 2025", "keywords": "lease, rent, deposit, notice period, landlord"}